  "body": "Located within the Rangitoto College enrolment zone, 29 Squirrel Lane presents a compelling opportunity for developers seeking a well-positioned Auckland project with strong end-buyer appeal. This popular school zone adds an important point of difference when marketing the completed homes to family buyers.\r\n\r\nA key advantage is that the neighbouring owner has agreed to provide access to the newly built manhole next to the lot.\r\n\r\nWhy this site stands out:\r\n• 714m² of land\r\n• Mixed Housing Suburban Zone\r\n• In zone for Rangitoto College\r\n• Attractive outlook\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac setting, away from the main road\r\n• Proven examples of completed and successfully marketed new-build projects nearby\r\n• New homes in the local area continue to attract encouraging buyer interest\r\n\r\nCompared with many competing sites, 29 Squirrel Lane combines the Rangitoto College zone, elevation, views, privacy and a peaceful street position—qualities that can translate into a highly marketable finished product.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a parcel of land. It is an opportunity to create homes with the location advantages family buyers actively seek.",
